IOUS, a. अनसूयः -या -यं -यकः -का -कं, निःस्पृहः -हा -हं.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "unequal": [{"id": "unequal", "headword": "unequal", "headword_slp1": "unequal", "fold": "unequal", "headword_language": "en", "source": "mw-english-sanskrit", "senses": [{"gloss": "UNEQUAL, a. असमः -मा -मं, असमानः -ना -नं, विषमः -मा -मं, न्यूना-\nधिकः -का -कं; ‘unequal division,’ विषमविभागः, see INADEQUATE.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "unequaled": [{"id": "unequalled", "headword": "unequalled", "headword_slp1": "unequalled", "fold": "unequaled", "headword_language": "en", "source": "mw-english-sanskrit", "senses": [{"gloss": "UNEQUALLED, a. अनुपमः -मा -मं, अप्रतिमः &c. See INCOMPARABLE.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "unequaly": [{"id": "unequally", "headword": "unequally", "headword_slp1": "unequally", "fold": "unequaly", "headword_language": "en", "source": "mw-english-sanskrit", "senses": [{"gloss": "UNEQUALLY, adv. असमं, विषमं, असमानं, वैषम्येण, न्यूनाधिकं.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "unequivocal": [{"id": "unequivocal", "headword": "unequivocal", "headword_slp1": "unequivocal", "fold": "unequivocal", "headword_language": "en", "source": "mw-english-sanskrit", "senses": [{"gloss": "UNEQUIVOCAL, a. सुस्पष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं, वीतसन्देहः &c. See CLEAR.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "unering": [{"id": "unerring", "headword": "unerring", "headword_slp1": "unerring", "fold": "unering", "headword_language": "en", "source": "mw-english-sanskrit", "senses": [{"gloss": "UNERRING, a. अमोघः -घा -घं, अभ्रान्तः -न्ता -न्तं, अमोघपातः -ता -तं,\nअबन्ध्यपातः &c.; ‘of unerring sight,’ अमोघदृष्टिः -ष्टिः -ष्टि.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "uneven": [{"id": "uneven", "headword": "uneven", "headword_slp1": "uneven", "fold": "uneven", "headword_language": "en", "source": "mw-english-sanskrit", "senses": [{"gloss": "UNEVEN, a. (Not level) असमः -मा -मं, विषमः &c., एकपार्श्वविषमः\n&c., साचिस्थितः -ता -तं, उन्नतानतः &c., see UNDULATING, ODD.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "unevenly": [{"id": "unevenly